Selling & Marketing Exp |       113.71 |       116.08 |       116.49 |       115.78 |\n| R&D Exp                 |       300.00 |       300.92 |       313.12 |       339.49 |\n| General & Admin Exp     |        80.07 |        71.09 |        77.40 |        81.66 |\n| Operating Income        |       498.32 |       365.75 |       445.55 |       502.80 |\n| Operating Margin (%)    |        28.74 |        24.27 |        24.83 |        26.14 |\n| Net Income              |       458.70 |       303.52 |       392.06 |       380.25 |\n| Net Margin (%)          |        26.45 |        20.14 |        21.85 |        19.77 |\n| Op Cash Flow            |      -386.59 |      -390.31 |       413.99 |       538.77 |\n| Investing Cash Flow     |       -30.15 |        -2.96 |         6.33 |        52.82 |\n| Financing Cash Flow     |        -1.81 |        -1.98 |     -1495.72 |        -2.87 |\n| CAPEX                   |        -4.39 |        -3.68 |       -10.53 |       -14.40 |"
